{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/false-systems/sykli/pulls/25","id":4468434906,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTuIjy88AAAABClbn2g","html_url":"https://github.com/false-systems/sykli/pull/25","diff_url":"https://github.com/false-systems/sykli/pull/25.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/false-systems/sykli/pull/25.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/false-systems/sykli/issues/25","number":25,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix permission-sensitive cache reuse and require workspace self-checks","user":{"login":"yairfalse","id":154441282,"node_id":"U_kgDOCTSWQg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154441282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yairfalse","html_url":"https://github.com/yairfalse","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yairfalse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yairfalse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yairfalse/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yairfalse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yairfalse/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yairfalse/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yairfalse/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yairfalse/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yairfalse/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Removing an input script's executable permission previously left its legacy cache key unchanged, allowing a failing command to return cached success. Cache lookup and receipt input verification now share an identity containing the file content hash and Unix execute bits. Old content-only cache entries miss, and old receipts with declared inputs must be regenerated.\n\nThe separate self-production commit makes Sykli's own target require the full Cargo workspace suite and declares Go so Go production tests cannot silently skip due to a missing executable.\n\nValidation:\n- Regression covers unchanged-input cache hits, permission-change failure, stale receipt rejection for a Git-ignored input, and reuse after restoring permissions.\n- `toimija gates run sykli-full` passed on tree `a40a1e78ad2e84e05bc49ba7ab9c95e8efaedd39` (the committed tree).\n- Installed Sykli built the candidate from captured source and passed the workspace and smoke checks: production `b47ed2d02a117258cdb76825802918aed42786fa0bd8a429c80e79510f039d75`, executable SHA256 `054de711de5cc3e53acd49aafcfe21e226655bd2875b2f9e94af230f61c87455`.\n- `toimija verify` passed. Execution validation was on macOS aarch64; the self-production contract retains its existing native target.\n","created_at":"2026-09-07T23:15:18Z","updated_at":"2026-09-07T23:15:18Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"64f42f51ca4832808aeb057aaa78583c7ac6d09a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/false-systems/sykli/pulls/25/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/false-systems/sykli/pulls/25/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/false-systems/sykli/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/false-systems/sykli/issues/25/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/false-systems/sykli/statuses/0e1982a239a0bd02299ab17de29bd52d17842763","head":{"label":"false-systems:fix/self-workspace-check","ref":"fix/self-workspace-check","sha":"0e1982a239a0bd02299ab17de29bd52d17842763","user":{"login":"false-systems","id":261534808,"node_id":"O_kgDOD5a0WA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/261534808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/false-systems","html_url":"https://github.com/false-systems","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/false-systems/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/false-systems/following